The numbers is a list of 1, 2, and 3.
Sort numbers.
The last is the last position of numbers.
The middle is last divided by 2.
The median is item middle of numbers.
The moves is 0.
For each value in numbers.
The diff is value minus median.
If diff is less than 0, set diff to 0 minus diff.
Add diff to moves.

Show moves.
